Answer

Answer #1.

| Condition |Feeling Thermometer (0-100) | Resettlement (0-1) | Schooling (1-5) | Benefits (1-5)|
|---|---|---|---|---|
| (Unweighted) Religious values message | 9.362 | 0.018 | -0.018 | -0.14 |
